# List of the vendor references already mapped (vendorref_list.php)
MappedVendorRefs=Preisreferenzen von Produktlieferanten
MappedVendorRefsDesc=This page lists in one place all the supplier reference prices of your products. This vendor product ref is what the import of a supplier invoice uses first to find the product matching the line of an imported invoice. It is recommended to not use this screen to edit a supplier product price reference, but to do it from the tab Supplier price of each product.
